# Environment files
# Only VITE-prefixed values may ever go in env files because they are compiled
# into the public client bundle. Server-side secrets such as the Supabase
# service role key and the Stripe secret key must live only in Supabase Edge
# Function secrets.
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
